 "- **Baseline-first** — The simplest system that could work, shipped first. It bounds the problem and often reveals the 'ML' wasn't needed.",
 "- **Deployment challenges checklist** — Latency, throughput, data drift, feedback loops, rollback, monitoring, cost. The list you run before building, not after launching.",
 "- **Error analysis habit** — Slicing failures to find the fixable patterns. Production ML is 80% error analysis — the model is the easy part.",
 "- **The scoping brief** — One document: decision, metrics, data, labels, baseline, risks, deployment checklist. The artifact this module produces."
